">\n              \n                <li class=\"navigation-item\">\n\n                  <a class=\"navigation-link link\" href=\"/information-releases/request-official-information\">\n                    \n                    <span class=\"english\" lang=\"en\">Request official information</span>\n                  </a>\n\n                </li>\n              \n                <li class=\"navigation-item\">\n\n                  <a class=\"navigation-link link\" href=\"/information-releases/request-personal-information\">\n                    \n                    <span class=\"english\" lang=\"en\">Request personal information</span>\n                  </a>\n\n                </li>\n              \n                <li class=\"navigation-item\">\n\n                  <a class=\"navigation-link link\" href=\"/information-releases/proactive-information-releases\">\n                    \n                    <span class=\"english\" lang=\"en\">Proactive information releases</span>\n                  </a>\n\n                </li>\n              \n                <li class=\"navigation-item\">\n\n                  <a class=\"navigation-link link\" href=\"/information-releases/official-information-act-responses\">\n                    \n                    <span class=\"english\" lang=\"en\">Official Information Act responses</span>\n                  </a>\n\n                </li>\n              \n            </ul>\n          </li>\n        \n      \n        \n          <li class=\"navigation-item navigation-item-top has-children \">\n\n            <a class=\"navigation-link link\" href=\"/working-for-us\">\n              <span class=\"maori\" lang=\"mi\">Te mahi m\u0101 m\u0101tou</span>\n              <span class=\"english\" lang=\"en\">Working for us</span>\n            </a>\n\n            <button class=\"navigation-chevron\" role=\"button\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#navigation-submenu-147\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"navigation-submenu-147\">\n              <span class=\"visually-hidden\">Show submenu for Working for us</span>\n            </button>\n\n            <ul id=\"navigation-submenu-147\" class=\"navigation-submenu collapse\" data-parent=\"#main-navigation\">\n              \n                <li class=\"navigation-item\">\n\n                  <a class=\"navigation-link link\" href=\"/working-for-us/diversity-and-inclusion-at-gcsb\">\n                    \n                    <span class=\"english\" lang=\"en\">Diversity and inclusion</span>\n                  </a>\n\n                </li>\n              \n                <li class=\"navigation-item\">\n\n                  <a class=\"navigation-link link\" href=\"/working-for-us/graduate-programme\">\n                    \n                    <span class=\"english\" lang=\"en\">Graduate programme</span>\n                  </a>\n\n                </li>\n              \n                <li class=\"navigation-item\">\n\n                  <a class=\"navigation-link link\" href=\"/working-for-us/women-in-stem-scholarship\">\n                    \n                    <span class=\"english\" lang=\"en\">GCSB Women in STEM Scholarship</span>\n                  </a>\n\n                </li>\n              \n            </ul>\n          </li>\n        \n      \n        \n          <li class=\"navigation-item navigation-item-top\">\n\n            <a class=\"navigation-link link last\" href=\"/contact\">\n              <span class=\"maori\" lang=\"mi\">Whakap\u0101 mai</span>\n              <span class=\"english\" lang=\"en\">Contact us</span>\n            </a>\n\n          </li>\n        \n      \n    </ul>\n  </nav>\n</div>\n\n    </div>\n    \n\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n        <div class=\"fade-overlay\"></div>\n    \n\n    <main role=\"main\" id=\"main\">\n      \n  <div class=\"page-banner\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"page-banner-inner\">\n        \n        <h1 class=\"page-banner-title\">News</h1>\n        \n        <p class=\"page-banner-content\">\n        Our media releases and copies of speeches by the Director-General of the Government Communications Security Bureau (GCSB). \n        </p>\n        \n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"container container-news-page\">\n  <div class=\"page\">\n    <div class=\"row\">\n      <div class=\"col-lg-9\">\n        <div class=\"content\">\n\n          \n    \n\t   <div class=\"element-column-holder has-background-colour\" id=\"e1502\" style=\"background-color:#eaf7fa\">\n  <div class=\"element-container element-column\">\n    \n    <div class=\"row\">\n      \n\n  \n  <div class=\"col-lg-12 col-md-12\">\n    <div class=\"hero-content content hero-content-padding\">\n      <p>Sign up to receive an email notification when news is published to this website.</p>\n      \n        <a class=\"hero-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"external\" href=\"https://confirmsubscription.com/h/y/8B9801A6031252A4\" title=\"\" style=\"color: ; \">Subscribe</a>\n      \n    </div>\n  </div>\n  \n\n\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n    \n\n\n          \n            \n         <ul class=\"news\">\n            \n                \n<li class=\"news-item \">\n\n  \n\n  <a class=\"news-item-link\" href=\"/news/gcsb-welcomes-new-deputy-director-general-cyber-security\" title=\"Read more about 'GCSB welcomes new Deputy Director-General Cyber Security'...\">\n    <h2 class=\"news-item-heading\">\n    \n      GCSB welcomes new Deputy Director-General Cyber Security\n    \n    </h2>\n  </a>\n\n  <ul class=\"news-item-details list-inline\">\n    <li class=\"news-detail-item news-detail-item-date\">\n      Posted\n      <span class=\"news-item-date\" href=\"/news/archive/2026/3/10\">March 10, 2026</span>\n    </li>\n    \n      <li class=\"news-detail-item\">\n        <a class=\"news-item-tag\" href=\"/news/category/media-releases\">Media Releases</a>\n      </li>\n    \n  </ul>\n\n  \n    \n    <p>The Government Communications Security Bureau (GCSB) has announced the appointment of Catriona Robinson as the head of the National Cyber Security Centre (NCSC).</p>\n    \n  \n  <a class=\"news-item-readmore-link\" href=\"/news/gcsb-welcomes-new-deputy-director-general-cyber-security\" title=\"Read more about 'GCSB welcomes new Deputy Director-General Cyber Security'...\">Read more</a>\n</li>\n\n            \n                \n<li class=\"news-item \">\n\n  \n\n  <a class=\"news-item-link\" href=\"/news/statement-to-the-intelligence-and-security-committee-by-director-general-andrew-clark-4-march-2026\" title=\"Read more about 'Statement to the Intelligence and Security Committee by Director-General Andrew Clark 4 March 2026'...\">\n    <h2 class=\"news-item-heading\">\n    \n      Statement to the Intelligence and Security Committee by Director-General Andrew Clark 4 March 2026\n    \n    </h2>\n  </a>\n\n  <ul class=\"news-item-details list-inline\">\n    <li class=\"news-detail-item news-detail-item-date\">\n      Posted\n      <span class=\"news-item-date\" href=\"/news/archive/2026/3/4\">March 04, 2026</span>\n    </li>\n    \n      <li class=\"news-detail-item\">\n        <a class=\"news-item-tag\" href=\"/news/category/director-general-speeches\">Director-General Speeches</a>\n      </li>\n    \n  </ul>\n\n  \n    \n    <p>Wednesday 4 March, 2026 Good afternoon Prime Minister and Committee members.</p>\n    \n  \n  <a class=\"news-item-readmore-link\" href=\"/news/statement-to-the-intelligence-and-security-committee-by-director-general-andrew-clark-4-march-2026\" title=\"Read more about 'Statement to the Intelligence and Security Committee by Director-General Andrew Clark 4 March 2026'...\">Read more</a>\n</li>\n\n            \n                \n<li class=\"news-item \">\n\n  \n\n  <a class=\"news-item-link\" href=\"/news/the-gcsb-farewells-deputy-director-general-cyber-security-lisa-fong\" title=\"Read more about 'The GCSB farewells Deputy Director-General Cyber Security, Lisa Fong'...\">\n    <h2 class=\"news-item-heading\">\n    \n      The GCSB farewells Deputy Director-General Cyber Security, Lisa Fong\n    \n    </h2>\n  </a>\n\n  <ul class=\"news-item-details list-inline\">\n    <li class=\"news-detail-item news-detail-item-date\">\n      Posted\n      <span class=\"news-item-date\" href=\"/news/archive/2025/10/22\">October 22, 2025</span>\n    </li>\n    \n      <li class=\"news-detail-item\">\n        <a class=\"news-item-tag\" href=\"/news/category/media-releases\">Media Releases</a>\n      </li>\n    \n  </ul>\n\n  \n    <p>The Government Communications Security Bureau today announced that the head of the National Cyber Security Centre, Lisa Fong, will step down after 13 years.</p>\n  \n  <a class=\"news-item-readmore-link\" href=\"/news/the-gcsb-farewells-deputy-director-general-cyber-security-lisa-fong\" title=\"Read more about 'The GCSB farewells Deputy Director-General Cyber Security, Lisa Fong'...\">Read more</a>\n</li>\n\n            \n                \n<li class=\"news-item \">\n\n  \n\n  <a class=\"news-item-link\" href=\"/news/all-of-government-data-centre-opened-at-whenuapai-ceremony\" title=\"Read more about 'All-of-Government data centre opened at Whenuapai ceremony'...\">\n    <h2 class=\"news-item-heading\">\n    \n      All-of-Government data centre opened at Whenuapai ceremony\n    \n    </h2>\n  </a>\n\n  <ul class=\"news-item-details list-inline\">\n    <li class=\"news-detail-item news-detail-item-date\">\n      Posted\n      <span class=\"news-item-date\" href=\"/news/archive/2025/6/27\">June 27, 2025</span>\n    </li>\n    \n      <li class=\"news-detail-item\">\n        <a class=\"news-item-tag\" href=\"/news/category/media-releases\">Media Releases</a>\n      </li>\n    \n  </ul>\n\n  \n    <p>The Government Communications Security Bureau (GCSB) has taken possession of the all-of-government data centre following an opening ceremony at RNZAF Base Auckland.</p>\n  \n  <a class=\"news-item-readmore-link\" href=\"/news/all-of-government-data-centre-opened-at-whenuapai-ceremony\" title=\"Read more about 'All-of-Government data centre opened at Whenuapai ceremony'...\">Read more</a>\n</li>\n\n            \n                \n<li class=\"news-item \">\n\n  \n\n  <a class=\"news-item-link\" href=\"/news/opening-statement-to-the-intelligence-and-security-committee-19-february-2025\" title=\"Read more about 'Statement to the Intelligence and Security Committee by Director-General Andrew Clark 19 February 2025'...\">\n    <h2 class=\"news-item-heading\">\n    \n      Statement to the Intelligence and Security Committee by Director-General Andrew Clark 19 February 2025\n    \n    </h2>\n  </a>\n\n  <ul class=\"news-item-details list-inline\">\n    <li class=\"news-detail-item news-detail-item-date\">\n      Posted\n      <span class=\"news-item-date\" href=\"/news/archive/2025/2/20\">February 20, 2025</span>\n    </li>\n    \n      <li class=\"news-detail-item\">\n        <a class=\"news-item-tag\" href=\"/news/category/director-general-speeches\">Director-General Speeches</a>\n      </li>\n    \n  </ul>\n\n  \n    \n    <p>Wednesday 19 February, 2025 &amp;nbsp; Prime Minister and Committee members, t\u0113n\u0101 koutou katoa Thank you for this opportunity to update you on the work of the Government Communications Security Bureau.&amp;nbsp; As New Zealand\u2019s lead organisation for signals intelligence and cyber security, we\u2019re predominantly outward-looking.</p>\n    \n  \n  <a class=\"news-item-readmore-link\" href=\"/news/opening-statement-to-the-intelligence-and-security-committee-19-february-2025\" title=\"Read more about 'Statement to the Intelligence and Security Committee by Director-General Andrew Clark 19 February 2025'...\">Read more</a>\n</li>\n\n            \n                \n<li class=\"news-item \">\n\n  \n\n  <a class=\"news-item-link\" href=\"/news/the-ncsc-delivers-all-recommendations-following-ipac-review\" title=\"Read more about 'The NCSC delivers all recommendations following IPAC review'...\">\n    <h2 class=\"news-item-heading\">\n    \n      The NCSC delivers all recommendations following IPAC review\n    \n    </h2>\n  </a>\n\n  <ul class=\"news-item-details list-inline\">\n    <li class=\"news-detail-item news-detail-item-date\">\n      Posted\n      <span class=\"news-item-date\" href=\"/news/archive/2024/12/20\">December 20, 2024</span>\n    </li>\n    \n      <li class=\"news-detail-item\">\n        <a class=\"news-item-tag\" href=\"/news/category/media-releases\">Media Releases</a>\n      </li>\n    \n  </ul>\n\n  \n    <p>The GCSB\u2019s National Cyber Security Centre (NCSC) has implemented all improvements identified by the review of malicious cyber activity targeting members of the Inter-Parliamentary Alliance on China (IPAC).</p>\n  \n  <a class=\"news-item-readmore-link\" href=\"/news/the-ncsc-delivers-all-recommendations-following-ipac-review\" title=\"Read more about 'The NCSC delivers all recommendations following IPAC review'...\">Read more</a>\n</li>\n\n            \n                \n<li class=\"news-item \">\n\n  \n\n  <a class=\"news-item-link\" href=\"/news/nzsis-and-ncsc-launch-security-advice-for-tech-start-ups-alongside-five-eyes-partners\" title=\"Read more about 'NZSIS and NCSC launch security advice for tech start-ups alongside Five Eyes partners'...\">\n    <h2 class=\"news-item-heading\">\n    \n      NZSIS and NCSC launch security advice for tech start-ups alongside Five Eyes partners\n    \n    </h2>\n  </a>\n\n  <ul class=\"news-item-details list-inline\">\n    <li class=\"news-detail-item news-detail-item-date\">\n      Posted\n      <span class=\"news-item-date\" href=\"/news/archive/2024/10/29\">October 29, 2024</span>\n    </li>\n    \n      <li class=\"news-detail-item\">\n        <a class=\"news-item-tag\" href=\"/news/category/media-releases\">Media Releases</a>\n      </li>\n    \n  </ul>\n\n  \n    <p>The New Zealand intelligence agencies have today launched new security guidance to help protect emerging technology companies from a range of threats, particularly those posed by foreign-state actors.</p>\n  \n  <a class=\"news-item-readmore-link\" href=\"/news/nzsis-and-ncsc-launch-security-advice-for-tech-start-ups-alongside-five-eyes-partners\" title=\"Read more about 'NZSIS and NCSC launch security advice for tech start-ups alongside Five Eyes partners'...\">Read more</a>\n</li>\n\n            \n                \n<li class=\"news-item \">\n\n  \n\n  <a class=\"news-item-link\" href=\"/news/ncsc-review-of-response-to-ipac-incident\" title=\"Read more about 'NCSC review of response to IPAC incident released'...\">\n    <h2 class=\"news-item-heading\">\n    \n      NCSC review of response to IPAC incident released\n    \n    </h2>\n  </a>\n\n  <ul class=\"news-item-details list-inline\">\n    <li class=\"news-detail-item news-detail-item-date\">\n      Posted\n      <span class=\"news-item-date\" href=\"/news/archive/2024/7/15\">July 15, 2024</span>\n    </li>\n    \n      <li class=\"news-detail-item\">\n        <a class=\"news-item-tag\" href=\"/news/category/media-releases\">Media Releases</a>\n      </li>\n    \n  </ul>\n\n  \n    <p><span><span class=\"ui-provider a b c d e f g h i j k l m n o p q r s t u v w x y z ab ac ae af ag ah ai aj ak\">A review of the GCSB\u2019s National Cyber Security Centre\u2019s (NCSC\u2019s) practices and procedures arising out of reported malicious cyber activity targeting members of the Inter-Parliamentary Alliance on China (IPAC).</span></span></p>\n  \n  <a class=\"news-item-readmore-link\" href=\"/news/ncsc-review-of-response-to-ipac-incident\" title=\"Read more about 'NCSC review of response to IPAC incident released'...\">Read more</a>\n</li>\n\n            \n                \n<li class=\"news-item \">\n\n  \n\n  <a class=\"news-item-link\" href=\"/news/response-to-igis-report-on-human-rights-risk-assessments\" title=\"Read more about 'Response to IGIS report on Human Rights Risk Assessments'...\">\n    <h2 class=\"news-item-heading\">\n    \n      Response to IGIS report on Human Rights Risk Assessments\n    \n    </h2>\n  </a>\n\n  <ul class=\"news-item-details list-inline\">\n    <li class=\"news-detail-item news-detail-item-date\">\n      Posted\n      <span class=\"news-item-date\" href=\"/news/archive/2024/7/4\">July 04, 2024</span>\n    </li>\n    \n      <li class=\"news-detail-item\">\n        <a class=\"news-item-tag\" href=\"/news/category/media-releases\">Media Releases</a>\n      </li>\n    \n  </ul>\n\n  \n    \n    <p>The NZSIS and GCSB welcome the baseline review by the Inspector-General of Intelligence and Security (IGIS) into how the agencies carry out Human Rights Risk Assessments (HRRA) to assess the risk of potential cooperation with overseas partners.</p>\n    \n  \n  <a class=\"news-item-readmore-link\" href=\"/news/response-to-igis-report-on-human-rights-risk-assessments\" title=\"Read more about 'Response to IGIS report on Human Rights Risk Assessments'...\">Read more</a>\n</li>\n\n            \n                \n<li class=\"news-item \">\n\n  \n\n  <a class=\"news-item-link\" href=\"/news/ncsc-briefs-ipac-representatives-on-response-to-malicious-cyber-activity\" title=\"Read more about 'NCSC briefs IPAC representatives on response to malicious cyber activity'...\">\n    <h2 class=\"news-item-heading\">\n    \n      NCSC briefs IPAC representatives on response to malicious cyber activity\n    \n    </h2>\n  </a>\n\n  <ul class=\"news-item-details list-inline\">\n    <li class=\"news-detail-item news-detail-item-date\">\n      Posted\n      <span class=\"news-item-date\" href=\"/news/archive/2024/5/8\">May 08, 2024</span>\n    </li>\n    \n      <li class=\"news-detail-item\">\n        <a class=\"news-item-tag\" href=\"/news/category/media-releases\">Media Releases</a>\n      </li>\n    \n  </ul>\n\n  \n    <p>Representatives from the GCSB\u2019s National Cyber Security Centre (NCSC) have spoken with current and former New Zealand members of Inter-Parliamentary Alliance on China (IPAC) regarding reports of malicious cyber activity targeting members of IPAC in 2021.</p>\n  \n  <a class=\"news-item-readmore-link\" href=\"/news/ncsc-briefs-ipac-representatives-on-response-to-malicious-cyber-activity\" title=\"Read more about 'NCSC briefs IPAC representatives on response to malicious cyber activity'...\">Read more</a>\n</li>\n\n            \n        </ul>\n\n          \n\n          \n            \n                \n\n<nav class=\"pagination-custom-holder aria-label=\"news pagination\">\n    <ul class=\"pagination-custom content\">\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<li class=\"pagination-item disabled\"><a class=\"pagination-link\" href=\"/news?url=news#\" aria-disabled=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\">1</a></li>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"pagination-item\"><a class=\"pagination-link\" href=\"/news?url=news&amp;start=10\">2</a></li>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"pagination-item\"><a class=\"pagination-link\" href=\"/news?url=news&amp;start=20\">3</a></li>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"pagination-item\"><a class=\"pagination-link\" href=\"/news?url=news&amp;start=30\">4</a></li>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"pagination-item\"><a class=\"pagination-link\" href=\"/news?url=news&amp;start=40\">5</a></li>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"pagination-item disabled\">\n                        <a class=\"pagination-link\" href=\"/news?url=news#\" aria-disabled=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n                        ...\n                        </a>\n                    </li>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"pagination-item\"><a class=\"pagination-link\" href=\"/news?url=news&amp;start=110\">12</a></li>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<li class=\"pagination-item\"><a class=\"pagination-link\" href=\"/news?url